{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_10138020","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10138020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"subtitle:2:1013803001:":{"text":"是地面在震动！大家小心站稳！","source_cn":"是地面在震动！大家小心站稳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E998AD36C251E6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013802001:0":{"text":"诸位，请止步。前方在举行重要的仪式，不能被打扰。","source_cn":"诸位，请止步。前方在举行重要的仪式，不能被打扰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE8D5FF72F6CBF13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013802002:0":{"text":"看来，你们在举行与圣物有关的仪式。艾雅在上，圣骑士特弥希娅奉命前来——","source_cn":"看来，你们在举行与圣物有关的仪式。艾雅在上，圣骑士特弥...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9960143F5065B55E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1013802003:0":{"text":"等等，地面上这道黑雾弥漫的裂隙是怎么回事？","source_cn":"等等，地面上这道黑雾弥漫的裂隙是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80AD4A33D590F215","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1013802004:0":{"text":"中间这块发光的石头，就是咱们要保护的圣物吗？这到底是在举行什么仪式？","source_cn":"中间这块发光的石头，就是咱们要保护的圣物吗？这到底是在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31DC8F04926F56C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","d